English word list — provenance and licence
==========================================

Generated by scripts/build-dictionary-en.mjs from the npm package `word-list`.

  Package:  word-list
  Licence:  MIT
  Copyright (c) Sindre Sorhus <sindresorhus@gmail.com> (https://sindresorhus.com)

The package's own licence is MIT. The word data it ships is taken from
https://github.com/atebits/Words (Words/en.txt) — confirm that upstream
repository's terms before using this list somewhere the licence matters. The
package README states that one-letter words and many crude words are already
filtered out.

Only lengths 2–12 are kept, and only entries matching /^[a-z]+$/.
